curl -X GET "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/checkout/cart\\ \
?_expand=customer_profile%2Citems%2Cbilling%2Cshipping%2Ccoupons%2Ccheckout%2Cpayment%2Csummary%2Ctaxes" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 9e188d66d77f64019a05ae05ac80010039ccbebb1df9b9019a05ae05ac800100"
```

